{"segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 2.321, "text": " Nunca la hacienda valió tanto en dólares.", "words": [{"word": " Nunca", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.357}, {"word": " la", "start": 0.393, "end": 0.443}, {"word": " hacienda", "start": 0.5, "end": 0.857}, {"word": " valió", "start": 0.929, "end": 1.214}, {"word": " tanto", "start": 1.286, "end": 1.571}, {"word": " en", "start": 1.643, "end": 1.714}, {"word": " dólares.", "start": 1.75, "end": 2.321}]}, {"start": 2.429, "end": 4.071, "text": " Y hay ganaderos perdiendo plata.", "words": [{"word": " Y", "start": 2.429, "end": 2.5}, {"word": " hay", "start": 2.571, "end": 2.643}, {"word": " ganaderos", "start": 2.714, "end": 3.071}, {"word": " perdiendo", "start": 3.143, "end": 3.571}, {"word": " plata.", "start": 3.643, "end": 4.071}]}, {"start": 4.429, "end": 7.286, "text": " Mirá el precio en dólares de los últimos 25 años.", "words": [{"word": " Mirá", "start": 4.429, "end": 4.607}, {"word": " el", "start": 4.643, "end": 4.714}, {"word": " precio", "start": 4.857, "end": 5.0}, {"word": " en", "start": 5.036, "end": 5.086}, {"word": " dólares", "start": 5.143, "end": 5.5}, {"word": " de", "start": 5.643, "end": 5.714}, {"word": " los", "start": 5.786, "end": 5.857}, {"word": " últimos", "start": 5.929, "end": 6.214}, {"word": " 25", "start": 6.25, "end": 6.786}, {"word": " años.", "start": 6.929, "end": 7.286}]}, {"start": 7.643, "end": 11.071, "text": " En 2002 el novillo valía medio dólar el kilo; en", "words": [{"word": " En", "start": 7.643, "end": 7.714}, {"word": " 2002", "start": 7.786, "end": 8.214}, {"word": " el", "start": 8.5, "end": 8.571}, {"word": " novillo", "start": 8.643, "end": 8.929}, {"word": " valía", "start": 9.0, "end": 9.214}, {"word": " medio", "start": 9.429, "end": 9.714}, {"word": " dólar", "start": 9.786, "end": 10.071}, {"word": " el", "start": 10.107, "end": 10.157}, {"word": " kilo;", "start": 10.214, "end": 10.929}, {"word": " en", "start": 11.0, "end": 11.071}]}, {"start": 11.143, "end": 13.5, "text": " marzo de este año tocó tres coma uno.", "words": [{"word": " marzo", "start": 11.143, "end": 11.429}, {"word": " de", "start": 11.464, "end": 11.514}, {"word": " este", "start": 11.607, "end": 11.714}, {"word": " año", "start": 11.786, "end": 12.0}, {"word": " tocó", "start": 12.143, "end": 12.429}, {"word": " tres", "start": 12.643, "end": 12.786}, {"word": " coma", "start": 12.929, "end": 13.071}, {"word": " uno.", "start": 13.214, "end": 13.5}]}, {"start": 13.929, "end": 16.571, "text": " Y el ternero hoy vale casi cuatro dólares:", "words": [{"word": " Y", "start": 13.929, "end": 13.979}, {"word": " el", "start": 14.0, "end": 14.05}, {"word": " ternero", "start": 14.071, "end": 14.5}, {"word": " hoy", "start": 14.643, "end": 14.786}, {"word": " vale", "start": 14.893, "end": 15.0}, {"word": " casi", "start": 15.036, "end": 15.286}, {"word": " cuatro", "start": 15.429, "end": 15.714}, {"word": " dólares:", "start": 15.786, "end": 16.571}]}, {"start": 16.643, "end": 19.071, "text": " el doble que el promedio de los últimos diez años.", "words": [{"word": " el", "start": 16.643, "end": 16.714}, {"word": " doble", "start": 16.786, "end": 17.071}, {"word": " que", "start": 17.143, "end": 17.214}, {"word": " el", "start": 17.25, "end": 17.3}, {"word": " promedio", "start": 17.357, "end": 17.714}, {"word": " de", "start": 17.75, "end": 17.8}, {"word": " los", "start": 17.857, "end": 17.929}, {"word": " últimos", "start": 18.0, "end": 18.286}, {"word": " diez", "start": 18.357, "end": 18.571}, {"word": " años.", "start": 18.643, "end": 19.071}]}, {"start": 19.5, "end": 21.0, "text": " ¿Entonces todos ganan más?", "words": [{"word": " ¿Entonces", "start": 19.5, "end": 20.071}, {"word": " todos", "start": 20.214, "end": 20.429}, {"word": " ganan", "start": 20.464, "end": 20.643}, {"word": " más?", "start": 20.714, "end": 21.0}]}, {"start": 21.5, "end": 21.964, "text": " No.", "words": [{"word": " No.", "start": 21.5, "end": 21.964}]}, {"start": 22.214, "end": 23.786, "text": " El precio es lo que vendés.", "words": [{"word": " El", "start": 22.214, "end": 22.286}, {"word": " precio", "start": 22.429, "end": 22.857}, {"word": " es", "start": 22.929, "end": 23.0}, {"word": " lo", "start": 23.071, "end": 23.121}, {"word": " que", "start": 23.143, "end": 23.214}, {"word": " vendés.", "start": 23.286, "end": 23.786}]}, {"start": 24.143, "end": 26.286, "text": " La ganancia es lo que te queda después de pagar", "words": [{"word": " La", "start": 24.143, "end": 24.214}, {"word": " ganancia", "start": 24.286, "end": 24.786}, {"word": " es", "start": 24.857, "end": 24.929}, {"word": " lo", "start": 25.0, "end": 25.05}, {"word": " que", "start": 25.071, "end": 25.143}, {"word": " te", "start": 25.214, "end": 25.357}, {"word": " queda", "start": 25.464, "end": 25.571}, {"word": " después", "start": 25.643, "end": 25.857}, {"word": " de", "start": 25.929, "end": 26.0}, {"word": " pagar", "start": 26.071, "end": 26.286}]}, {"start": 26.357, "end": 28.143, "text": " lo que compraste y lo que gastaste.", "words": [{"word": " lo", "start": 26.357, "end": 26.429}, {"word": " que", "start": 26.5, "end": 26.571}, {"word": " compraste", "start": 26.679, "end": 27.143}, {"word": " y", "start": 27.286, "end": 27.357}, {"word": " lo", "start": 27.393, "end": 27.443}, {"word": " que", "start": 27.5, "end": 27.571}, {"word": " gastaste.", "start": 27.607, "end": 28.143}]}, {"start": 28.643, "end": 29.714, "text": " La cría ganó:", "words": [{"word": " La", "start": 28.643, "end": 28.714}, {"word": " cría", "start": 28.786, "end": 29.0}, {"word": " ganó:", "start": 29.071, "end": 29.714}]}, {"start": 29.786, "end": 33.5, "text": " su margen está 40 % arriba del promedio, el mejor en", "words": [{"word": " su", "start": 29.786, "end": 29.857}, {"word": " margen", "start": 29.893, "end": 30.286}, {"word": " está", "start": 30.357, "end": 30.5}, {"word": " 40 %", "start": 30.643, "end": 31.5}, {"word": " arriba", "start": 31.571, "end": 31.786}, {"word": " del", "start": 31.857, "end": 31.929}, {"word": " promedio,", "start": 32.0, "end": 32.643}, {"word": " el", "start": 32.714, "end": 32.786}, {"word": " mejor", "start": 32.857, "end": 33.143}, {"word": " en", "start": 33.286, "end": 33.5}]}, {"start": 33.536, "end": 34.286, "text": " 15 años.", "words": [{"word": " 15", "start": 33.536, "end": 33.786}, {"word": " años.", "start": 33.929, "end": 34.286}]}, {"start": 34.714, "end": 38.571, "text": " Su margen cayó 18 % en un mes, y está 8 %", "words": [{"word": " Su", "start": 34.714, "end": 34.786}, {"word": " margen", "start": 34.857, "end": 35.214}, {"word": " cayó", "start": 35.357, "end": 35.571}, {"word": " 18 %", "start": 35.714, "end": 36.714}, {"word": " en", "start": 36.75, "end": 36.8}, {"word": " un", "start": 36.857, "end": 36.929}, {"word": " mes,", "start": 37.036, "end": 37.429}, {"word": " y", "start": 37.464, "end": 37.514}, {"word": " está", "start": 37.571, "end": 37.714}, {"word": " 8 %", "start": 37.929, "end": 38.571}]}, {"start": 38.643, "end": 39.643, "text": " abajo que hace un año.", "words": [{"word": " abajo", "start": 38.643, "end": 38.929}, {"word": " que", "start": 38.964, "end": 39.014}, {"word": " hace", "start": 39.071, "end": 39.214}, {"word": " un", "start": 39.25, "end": 39.3}, {"word": " año.", "start": 39.357, "end": 39.643}]}, {"start": 40.143, "end": 43.393, "text": " Y el feedlot pierde unos 53 dólares por cabeza.", "words": [{"word": " Y", "start": 40.143, "end": 40.193}, {"word": " el", "start": 40.214, "end": 40.286}, {"word": " feedlot", "start": 40.357, "end": 40.786}, {"word": " pierde", "start": 41.0, "end": 41.214}, {"word": " unos", "start": 41.321, "end": 41.429}, {"word": " 53", "start": 41.464, "end": 42.143}, {"word": " dólares", "start": 42.286, "end": 42.571}, {"word": " por", "start": 42.643, "end": 42.714}, {"word": " cabeza.", "start": 42.786, "end": 43.393}]}, {"start": 43.571, "end": 45.286, "text": " Si pidió crédito, el doble.", "words": [{"word": " Si", "start": 43.571, "end": 43.643}, {"word": " pidió", "start": 43.714, "end": 43.929}, {"word": " crédito,", "start": 44.0, "end": 44.643}, {"word": " el", "start": 44.714, "end": 44.786}, {"word": " doble.", "start": 44.857, "end": 45.286}]}, {"start": 45.857, "end": 48.643, "text": " Mismos precios récord, tres resultados distintos.", "words": [{"word": " Mismos", "start": 45.857, "end": 46.214}, {"word": " precios", "start": 46.286, "end": 46.5}, {"word": " récord,", "start": 46.571, "end": 47.214}, {"word": " tres", "start": 47.321, "end": 47.429}, {"word": " resultados", "start": 47.5, "end": 48.0}, {"word": " distintos.", "start": 48.107, "end": 48.643}]}, {"start": 49.071, "end": 51.214, "text": " El precio de uno es el costo del otro.", "words": [{"word": " El", "start": 49.071, "end": 49.143}, {"word": " precio", "start": 49.286, "end": 49.5}, {"word": " de", "start": 49.571, "end": 49.643}, {"word": " uno", "start": 49.714, "end": 49.929}, {"word": " es", "start": 50.071, "end": 50.214}, {"word": " el", "start": 50.25, "end": 50.3}, {"word": " costo", "start": 50.429, "end": 50.714}, {"word": " del", "start": 50.786, "end": 50.857}, {"word": " otro.", "start": 50.929, "end": 51.214}]}, {"start": 51.643, "end": 53.514, "text": " Hoy la cría es la que más gana y el", "words": [{"word": " Hoy", "start": 51.643, "end": 51.786}, {"word": " la", "start": 51.821, "end": 51.871}, {"word": " cría", "start": 51.929, "end": 52.286}, {"word": " es", "start": 52.357, "end": 52.429}, {"word": " la", "start": 52.464, "end": 52.514}, {"word": " que", "start": 52.571, "end": 52.714}, {"word": " más", "start": 52.75, "end": 52.857}, {"word": " gana", "start": 52.929, "end": 53.214}, {"word": " y", "start": 53.357, "end": 53.429}, {"word": " el", "start": 53.464, "end": 53.514}]}, {"start": 53.571, "end": 54.429, "text": " feedlot pierde.", "words": [{"word": " feedlot", "start": 53.571, "end": 53.929}, {"word": " pierde.", "start": 54.0, "end": 54.429}]}, {"start": 54.786, "end": 56.214, "text": " Pero no siempre fue así:", "words": [{"word": " Pero", "start": 54.786, "end": 54.929}, {"word": " no", "start": 55.0, "end": 55.071}, {"word": " siempre", "start": 55.143, "end": 55.429}, {"word": " fue", "start": 55.5, "end": 55.571}, {"word": " así:", "start": 55.643, "end": 56.214}]}, {"start": 56.286, "end": 58.5, "text": " hubo años en que la cría no era negocio.", "words": [{"word": " hubo", "start": 56.286, "end": 56.429}, {"word": " años", "start": 56.5, "end": 56.786}, {"word": " en", "start": 56.857, "end": 56.929}, {"word": " que", "start": 57.0, "end": 57.071}, {"word": " la", "start": 57.143, "end": 57.214}, {"word": " cría", "start": 57.286, "end": 57.571}, {"word": " no", "start": 57.643, "end": 57.786}, {"word": " era", "start": 57.857, "end": 57.929}, {"word": " negocio.", "start": 58.0, "end": 58.5}]}, {"start": 58.786, "end": 60.714, "text": " Y el que tiene un feedlot no lo cierra por", "words": [{"word": " Y", "start": 58.786, "end": 58.857}, {"word": " el", "start": 58.893, "end": 58.943}, {"word": " que", "start": 59.0, "end": 59.05}, {"word": " tiene", "start": 59.071, "end": 59.214}, {"word": " un", "start": 59.25, "end": 59.3}, {"word": " feedlot", "start": 59.357, "end": 59.786}, {"word": " no", "start": 60.0, "end": 60.071}, {"word": " lo", "start": 60.143, "end": 60.214}, {"word": " cierra", "start": 60.286, "end": 60.571}, {"word": " por", "start": 60.643, "end": 60.714}]}, {"start": 60.786, "end": 61.714, "text": " perder unos meses.", "words": [{"word": " perder", "start": 60.786, "end": 61.0}, {"word": " unos", "start": 61.071, "end": 61.214}, {"word": " meses.", "start": 61.286, "end": 61.714}]}, {"start": 62.071, "end": 64.857, "text": " Son ciclos, y nadie sabe cuánto dura este.", "words": [{"word": " Son", "start": 62.071, "end": 62.214}, {"word": " ciclos,", "start": 62.286, "end": 63.0}, {"word": " y", "start": 63.071, "end": 63.143}, {"word": " nadie", "start": 63.214, "end": 63.5}, {"word": " sabe", "start": 63.643, "end": 63.786}, {"word": " cuánto", "start": 63.929, "end": 64.214}, {"word": " dura", "start": 64.25, "end": 64.429}, {"word": " este.", "start": 64.5, "end": 64.857}]}, {"start": 65.286, "end": 67.714, "text": " Mandáselo al que dice que con estos precios la ganadería", "words": [{"word": " Mandáselo", "start": 65.286, "end": 65.714}, {"word": " al", "start": 65.75, "end": 65.8}, {"word": " que", "start": 65.857, "end": 65.929}, {"word": " dice", "start": 66.036, "end": 66.143}, {"word": " que", "start": 66.214, "end": 66.286}, {"word": " con", "start": 66.357, "end": 66.429}, {"word": " estos", "start": 66.5, "end": 66.643}, {"word": " precios", "start": 66.714, "end": 67.143}, {"word": " la", "start": 67.214, "end": 67.286}, {"word": " ganadería", "start": 67.357, "end": 67.714}]}, {"start": 67.786, "end": 68.714, "text": " es un negoción.", "words": [{"word": " es", "start": 67.786, "end": 67.857}, {"word": " un", "start": 67.893, "end": 67.943}, {"word": " negoción.", "start": 68.0, "end": 68.714}]}], "language": "es"}